{
  "description": "std-site-footer — the footer at the bottom of a public site: brand name and tagline, columns of links, and a bottom row with the copyright line and legal links. Links follow `href` (in-app path, #anchor, or absolute URL) and each click emits FOOTER_LINK_CLICKED. Pick for marketing sites, docs portals and product websites.",
